# Sitebrew: the repository-wide rules live in each top-level folder (not at the root): the plugin directory refuses content-rewriting
# attributes in a .gitattributes at the root, above the plugin folder or inside it. Written by the export (_tools/gitattributes.mjs).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
